00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.010
Get out of the way!

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:52.450
Saigo-san is passing through!

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:54.400
You are in the way!

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.070
I wonder what's the fuss about, Saigo-san.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.040
What's with those guys?

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:04.350
Hey, you!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.900
What do you want with our school?

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:12.960
Tenchuu Warrior Uma Kamen, Arrives

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.940
Uh... Excuse me.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.180
Could you find me the strongest man here, Inuzuka Koushi?

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:22.340
Huh?

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.730
Are you daydreaming?

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:29.940
The strongest man in this school is this person, Saigo Kazuyuki-san!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:34.620
He doesn't look that strong though.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.280
What did you say!?

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.730
Don't get cocky.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.760
Saigo-san is in an explosive mood...

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.900
That guy won't be leaving here alive.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:56.000
Beat him into a bloody pulp, Saigo-san!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.770
Then let's do some warm up.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.240
Sis, he is the one from yesterday...

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:27.870
Yeah.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.510
The man who mistook you for Koushi senpai.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.710
Which means...

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.720
He's an enemy who's after Koushi-dono.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:37.540
Eh?

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:42.940
Sa... Saigo-san...?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.670
I think I'm having a déjà vu...

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.050
This happens everytime when someone is after Inuzuka...

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:51.010
Ah! Inuzuka!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.280
I've found you, Inuzuka-dono.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:58.920
It's another assassin.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:03:59.890
What do I do?

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.560
Leave it to me.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.200
I will defeat him if he is a lowly assassin.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.490
I see.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.710
It's gonna be alright.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.660
I have her.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.950
An assassin? That's absurd.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:13.550
Huh?

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.400
I'm from the eastern branch just like Inuzuka-dono.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:21.870
I am Nakajima Hikaru of the Santera Shingo style.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.480
If you are in the eastern branch...

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.610
Then in other words...

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:27.770
You are an ally?

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.790
I've come today to have a match with Inuzuka-dono.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.550
If you are an ally, then why are you against Koushi-dono?

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.810
I'm not against him.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:39.700
I only want to duel with Inuzuka-dono.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:43.780
A duel with love at stake.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.760
Lo... Love!?

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:50.470
A man will display his strength to the woman he loves.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:53.640
That's the proposal ceremony of our clan.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.780
To marry my fiancée...

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:03.690
Inuzuka-dono, I have no other choice but to defeat you in a duel to prove my strength as a martial artist!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.450
Who... Who cares! What ceremony!?

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.060
Don't try to justify violence with pretty words!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:13.360
Article 34 of the Meiji Constitution, concerning duels...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.030
The person who tries to start a duel...

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.040
Fiancée...

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.300
Marriage...

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:23.430
The duel of love...

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.920
Hey, don't be fooled.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.300
She's my beloved fiancée.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:31.440
Beloved fiancée...

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:36.280
I want her to love me.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.690
I want her to acknowledge me.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:38.790
I want her to marry me.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.270
That's all I want!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.720
That's all he wants...

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.260
Please accept the duel, Koushi-dono.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.300
Hey!

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:52.190
It may be a bother, but please... Please...

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:54.710
I beg of you, I beg of you!

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.910
Hey, it has nothing to do with it being a bother.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.480
I totally... You know.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.750
It may be troublesome, but please... Please...

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.440
I beg of you, I beg of you!

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:09.400
Like I said, whether it's troublesome or not is not the issue here. OK?

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:14.040
What's with those eyes that seem to be expecting something?

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:19.850
Now to think of it, I've seen these eyes numerous times under crisis.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.710
When I was surrounded by the delinquents...

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:26.320
And when I had to fight the tiger assassin...

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:31.880
Hey,

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.950
I don't think it's possible,

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:38.000
but do you not realize that I'm weak?

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:38.850
Eh?

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.360
There is no way I can fight a big gorilla like that.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:49.020
Why are you being so humble?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.350
Sh... She doesn't realize it!

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:55.710
I'll do my best to cheer...

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.030
You dimwit! What exactly do you see in me!?

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.700
Inuzuka-dono, let's fight.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.410
No freaking way...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.710
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.190
Victory is ours!

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:12.760
It's my fault...

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.990
It's my fault that Inuzuka-kun is in danger...

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.090
I have to do something to help him...

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.070
Huh?

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:34.830
Is that you, Sanae?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.520
Oh my.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:43.650
Though I've decided not to wear it again...

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.100
But for Inuzuka-kun's sake...

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:47.670
Just one more time...

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.580
But the opponent this time is a real martial artist.

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.060
I wonder if this outfit will grant me enough power.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.560
What do I do...?

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:15.770
It's the third time I'm in a situation like this.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.210
Huh? Third time?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.910
Right, it's the third time.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.710
I managed to use my brain to get myself out of the last two.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.910
Hey, listen carefully.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.700
The article concerning duels...

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:33.910
It is a strict law against those who start duels and those who react in favor of duels.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:39.340
That means you, and even your beloved fiancée, are violating the law!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:45.500
Besides, what is required between a couple is mutual affection.

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.130
That's true love.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:51.090
Is that something you can obtain simply by beating an outsider like me?

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:54.130
To make a beloved person love you for your muscles...

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:55.980
Is that happiness?

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:58.500
How was that?

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.780
Have I persuaded him?

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.490
His reaction is peculiar.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.490
Inuzuka-dono!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.220
I... I...!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:20.190
Note: You may have noticed it already, Hikaru is not speaking standard Japanese(Kantou dialect). He's speaking Touhoku dialect, spoken in the northern regions of Japan.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.730
I don't really get those big words in standard Japanese.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.180
Huh?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.220
My only weapon...

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.920
We can't communicate!

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.740
It's alright.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.600
Martial artists...

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.900
...speak with martial arts.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:34.040
Talk about unreasonable.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:35.890
Hey, someone...

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.590
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.850
What do you think of this fight?

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:43.300
Koushi senpai will win, of course.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.880
All of them are abandoning me.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:49.800
Anyone...

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.740
Save me from this nightmare.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.720
Anyone!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.000
Are you alright, Inuzuka-kun?

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:06.970
Eh?

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:08.670
That voice...

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:09.330
Class rep?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.180
I'm not! Absolutely not!

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:16.580
I love the city, and peace. I'm the heroine of justice.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:23.860
Tenchuu warrior, Uma Kamen...

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:26.500
...will accept this duel in his place!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.450
Th... This person...

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.270
...is from back then.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.000
Who are you?

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.140
Eh... Uh... You see...

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.340
There is a message from Sanae-san.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:45.680
"Duelling the future leader of your own branch for your own self-interest..."

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.850
"Feel ashamed of yourself!"

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.270
It's alright.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.140
I can fight.

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:52.370
I can fight!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.480
<i>What's with this embarrassing outfit?</i>

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:04.770
<i>Your humiliation is the booster than can help you to surpass your pride and to stimulate your fighting instinct.</i>

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:05.620
<i>Eh?</i>

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:11.830
<i>If you wear that, you can suppress your fear and conquer your weaknesses.</i>

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:17.580
<i>In other words, you can fight against those macho men who you've always feared.</i>

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:24.740
To encourage myself to fight, I've fought in this outfit numerous times...

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.090
But it feels embarrassing no matter how many times I do it.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.480
But I have to endure this humiliation.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:35.700
I lost to humiliation at that time...

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:38.650
This time for sure...

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:43.100
By Sanae-san's request, I will accept this duel instead.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:47.280
If I win, will Sanae-san marry me?

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:48.320
Yes.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:52.520
Sanae-san considers this duel to be the proposal ceremony.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:54.530
Do you have the will to fight?

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:55.950
Of course!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:01.470
I will protect Inuzuka-kun today without running away!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:05.020
Let's fight!

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:38.300
This is a fight I can't lose, for Inuzuka-kun's sake, and for my own sake.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.720
I power upped myself because of it...

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:44.700
But it's just so embarrassing...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.970
I can't bare letting Inuzuka-kun looking at me any longer...

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:52.460
I need to settle this with this outfit...

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:53.710
<i>Sanae.</i>

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:59.460
<i>With that outfit, your strength is only at 20%.</i>

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:03.350
I'll win with 20%!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.690
Amazing battle aura.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:11.450
But I'll win!

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.870
I'll win, and make Sanae-san my bride!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.410
I'm saved...

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:17.730
Who is that person?

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:18.990
Who knows.

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.780
But it's unmistakable that she's an ally.

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:24.200
That is...

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:24.730
Huh?

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:25.990
Do you know something?

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.320
What cosplay is that?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:35.660
She looks like someone from the super hero animes from the 70s...

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.350
Maybe not.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:44.170
Note: "Tokusatsu" are live-action science fiction series, think Godzilla. "Sentai heroes" refers to series similiar/equavelent to Power Rangers.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:38.520
Tokusatsu?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:39.740
Sentai heroes?

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.970
Or someone from American comics?

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:43.850
Anyways, it's awesome.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:45.800
Excuse me!

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.340
May I take a picture?

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:50.010
Don't worry about it.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.330
Don't worry about it.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.490
Look over here.

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:54.840
Sorry, but...

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.740
I need to settle this quickly.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.340
It's over.

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.920
What's this?

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:13.330
A wimpy kick like this is not a kick.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:15.000
A kick is...

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.490
...like this!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.040
Not yet!

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:26.580
What do I do?

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:27.780
This person...

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:29.880
This person...!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:34.880
You are weak.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.320
He's really strong.

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.740
She looks wonderful even in danger.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:41.500
Hanzo, cut it out.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:43.290
How many pictures are you planning to take?

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:44.950
Hey, Hanzo.

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.810
What's this?

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.540
It's a digital camera.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.740
Where did you get the money to buy this?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:53.770
Give it back to me!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:57.700
I used the savings for restoring the syndicate.

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.890
Wha... What did you say...?

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.670
<i>Now is my chance! While I can still see it in my eyes!</i>

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:11.290
